WeaponPaints for s2script

Derived from cs2-WeaponPaints 3.3a by Nereziel & daffyy:
https://github.com/Nereziel/cs2-WeaponPaints
Reference: the main branch as published on 2026-11-09 (VERSION 3.3a).

The item catalogs in data/ (skins, gloves, agents, music kits, collectibles) and the
English phrases in translations/ are copied from that repository's website/data and
lang/en.json. Item images stay hosted by the upstream repository.

Modified 2026-11-09: ported from C#/CounterStrikeSharp to TypeScript/s2script.
Menus use s2script's menu module instead of MenuManagerCS2; persistence uses
s2script's database module instead of MySqlConnector/Dapper, keeping upstream's
table layout. Engine access goes through @s2script/cs2's schema accessors,
weapon.setAttribute and entity inputs, plus one plugin-declared engine call
(gamedata/functions.jsonc) for glove attributes. Behavior differences are listed
in README.md.

